# Only needed when the web app is deployed as a separate service from the API
# (e.g. two services on Voroa). Leave unset for local dev — Vite's own dev
# server proxies /api to localhost:4000 (see vite.config.ts) — and leave unset
# whenever the API is served from the same origin as the web app.
#
# Read at BUILD time (Vite inlines it into the bundle), so it must be set
# before `npm run build`, not just at runtime.
#
# No trailing slash.
# VITE_API_URL=https://summer-api.onvoroa.app
